# camera-demo

Capture and show one grayscale frame on an RGB565 display. Exit codes:
2 display initialization, 3 camera initialization, 4 capture, 5 geometry,
6 pixel transfer, 7 refresh, 8 camera sleep. The image remains on the LCD.
